   }
  ],
  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "Audio Instance Identification: identifies a (generic, non-speech) Basic Audio Object against the AudioSet taxonomy, producing an Audio Object Identifier (OSD-IID). The audio analogue of Visual Instance Identification. Engine: YAMNet. The audio arrives already mono, 16 kHz, 16-bit PCM (from Audio Qualifier Conversion), so the samples are read directly."
   }
  ],
