   }
  ],
  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "License Process Action (MMM-LCS): the User offering an Asset gives the User interested in the offer a Licence for it, with the Transact Service. DRAFT: the web specification (MMM-TEC V2.2, Process Actions, Table 2) lists the License Process Action and says who it involves, and its grammar gives the modifiers (Nil, To, With); it does not list the elements of its request and response. They are modelled on those of Post (MMM-PTP) and on the Licence Data Type (MMM-LIC), and are to be confirmed."
   }
  ],
